. So, the tool call should be get_traces with the service name "reservation" and a reasonable time frame, like 10 minutes.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"service": "reservation", "last_n_minutes": 10}', 'name': 'get_traces'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bec671d9953ae080', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 381, 'prompt_tokens': 3300, 'total_tokens': 3681, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfbcd-34eb-7f02-81f0-8e7a05ea51cf-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'get_traces', 'args': {'service': 'reservation', 'last_n_minutes': 10}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bec671d9953ae080', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3300, 'output_tokens': 381, 'total_tokens': 3681}), ToolMessage(content="('[]', 1)", id='3ccc163b-8e87-4e61-bf8a-3734afb54a9b', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-bec671d9953ae080'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='b2fbe09b-62f8-448d-9e14-f01f249ba4ec'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let\'s see. The user is trying to diagnose faults in the Hotel Reservation application, which has many microservices. So far, they\'ve checked the deployments, services, dependency graph, metrics for the reservation service, and traces for reservation. The dependency graph had no data, the metrics query for http_requests_total didn\'t return anything, and the traces for reservation were empty.\n\nHmm, maybe the reservation service isn\'t the only one with issues. The user should check other critical services. Let me think about the services listed earlier. There\'s frontend, geo, profile, rate, recommendation,