ing metrics, which would explain why previous metrics and traces queries returned empty results. This will help identify if the service is fundamentally non-functional.\n\ntool_call: {\n  "command": "get_operations",\n  "arguments": {\n    "service": "reservation"\n  }\n}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=361, prompt_tokens=3304, total_tokens=3665, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfbcd-a18d-7fb3-9627-4e77af992487-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3304, 'output_tokens': 361, 'total_tokens': 3665}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='74693165-cae9-4552-bfda-6d1aa0abea39')]]
